flowchart TD
    Human[Player / human-in-the-loop] -->|New game| Random[Random round generator<br/>range + attempt limit + uniform secret]
    Random --> Private[Private Game state<br/>secret stays inside game engine]
    Human -->|Submit guess| Input[Whole-number / range / repeat guardrails]
    Input -->|Rejected: no try consumed| UI[Streamlit game panel]
    Input -->|Accepted| Engine[Compare with secret<br/>update attempts, score and outcome]
    Private --> Engine
    Engine --> History[Player-visible history<br/>guesses + truthful higher/lower feedback]
    History --> UI
    Engine -->|Reveal secret only after round ends| UI
    Human -->|Question / quick action| Router[Coach input guardrail + intent router]
    History --> Snapshot[PublicGame snapshot<br/>range, try limit, history, status<br/>NO secret field]
    Private -->|Public fields only| Snapshot
    Router -->|Supported question| Orchestrator[Local reasoning agent<br/>select tools and plan workflow]
    Router -->|Unsupported / secret request| Refusal[Safe scoped response]
    Snapshot --> Orchestrator
    Orchestrator --> Retriever[Retriever<br/>intent routing + lexical ranking]
    Notes[Local probability, strategy, rules documents] --> Retriever
    Retriever --> Compose[Source-grounded response renderer]
    Orchestrator --> Math[Exact Fraction calculations<br/>posterior interval + odds]
    Math --> Planner[Midpoint plan<br/>what-if and feedback branches]
    Planner --> Verify[Verify probability bounds, achievable coverage,<br/>recommendation, context and round status]
    Verify -->|Pass| Compose
    Verify -->|Fail| Safe[Fail closed: no invented odds]
    Compose --> CoachUI[Coach panel<br/>explanation, citations and tool activity]
    Refusal --> CoachUI
    Safe --> CoachUI
    CoachUI -->|Fill suggestion; never auto-submit| Human
    Orchestrator --> Evidence[Bounded metadata logs<br/>public tool summaries / downloadable JSON]
    Tests[pytest + Streamlit AppTest + evaluate.py<br/>independent enumeration and optimality checks] -->|Verification| Math
    Tests -->|End-to-end validation| UI
    Tests -->|End-to-end validation| CoachUI
